OL,3,GNEWSAMonkey escapes from Highland
OL,4,AWildlife Park in Cairngorms
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young monkey has managed to get out
OL,7,Fof a wildlife park that was at the
OL,8,Fcentre of a similar monkey escape two
OL,9,Fyears ago.
OL,11,FThe Royal Zoological Society of
OL,12,FScotland (RZSS) said it was searching
OL,13,Ffor Luka after he disappeared overnight
OL,14,Ffrom the Highland Wildlife Park, near
OL,15,FAviemore, in the Cairngorms National
OL,16,FPark.
OL,18,FIn January 2024, another Japanese
OL,19,Fmacaque went on the run for more than
OL,20,Ffive days after it fled the park,
OL,21,Fapparently after a fight with other
OL,22,Fmale monkeys.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
